:"save-file","input_json":"{"instructions_reminder": "LIMIT THE FILE CONTENT TO AT MOST 300 LINES. IF MORE CONTENT NEEDS TO BE ADDED USE THE str-replace-editor TOOL TO EDIT THE FILE AFTER IT HAS BEEN CREATED.", "path": "src/main/resources/css/login.css", "file_content": "/* \u0417\u0430\u0433\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0456 \u0441\u0442\u0438\u043b\u0456 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0435\u043a\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0443 \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0437\u0430\u0446\u0456\u0457 */\n\n.root {\n -fx-background-color: linear-gradient(to bottom, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n -fx-font-family: \"Segoe UI\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\n.login-container {\n -fx-background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n -fx-background-radius: 15px;\n -fx-effect: dropshadow(gaussian, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 20, 0, 0, 5);\n -fx-max-width: 400px;\n -fx-min-width: 350px;\n}\n\n.app-title {\n -fx-text-fill: #2c3e50;\n -fx-font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.form-container {\n -fx-spacing: 15px;\n -fx-max-width: 300px;\n}\n\n.form-title {\n -fx-text-fill: #34495e;\n -fx-font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.form-field {\n -fx-pref-width: 280px;\n -fx-pref-height: 40px;\n -fx-background-color: #f8f9fa;\n -fx-border-color: #dee2e6;\n -fx-border-radius: 8px;\n -fx-background-radius: 8px;\n -fx-padding: 0 15px;\n -fx-font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.form-field:focused {\n -fx-border-color: #667eea;\n -fx-border-width: 2px;\n -fx-background-color: white;\n}\n\n.primary-button {\n -fx-pref-width: 280px;\n -fx-pref-height: 45px;\n -fx-background-color: linear-gradient(to bottom, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n -fx-text-fill: white;\n -fx-font-size: 16px;\n -fx-font-weight: bold;\n -fx-border-radius: 8px;\n -fx-background-radius: 8px;\n -fx-cursor: hand;\n -fx-effect: dropshadow(gaussian, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 5, 0, 0, 2);\n}\n\n.primary-button:hover {\n -fx-background-color: linear-gradient(to bottom, #5a6fd8 0%, #6a4190 100%);\n -fx-effect: dropshadow(gaussian, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 8, 0, 0, 3);\n}\n\n.primary-button:pressed {\n -fx-background-color: linear-gradient(to bottom, #4e5bc6 0%, #5e377e 100%);\n -fx-effect: dropshadow(gaussian, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 3, 0, 0, 1);\n}\n\n.primary-button:disabled {\n -fx-background-color: #bdc3c7;\n -fx-text-fill: #7f8c8d;\n -fx-effect: none;\n -fx-cursor: default;\n}\n\n.link-button {\n -fx-background-color: transparent;\n -fx-text-fill: #667eea;\n -fx-underline: false;\n -fx-cursor: hand;\n -fx-font-size: 14px;\n -fx-border-width: 0;\n}\n\n.link-button:hover {\n -fx-text-fill: #5a6fd8;\n -fx-underline: true;\n}\n\n.status-label {\n -fx-font-size: 14px;\n -fx-font-weight: bold;\n -fx-padding: 10px;\n -fx-background-radius: 5px;\n -fx-border-radius: 5px;\n}\n\n.progress-indicator {\n -fx-progress-color: #667eea;\n}\n\n/* \u0410\u043d\u0456\u043c\u0430\u0446\u0456\u0457 */\n.form-field {\n -fx-transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.primary-button {\n -fx-transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}"}","mcp_server_name":"","mcp_tool_name":""}},{"id":0,"type":0,"content":"Тепер створимо CSS стилі для авторизації:
